FPS · batt · lock · seq" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F0E6;strokeColor=#3D5A40;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="400" width="300" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="18" value="Hardware profiles
v1 HUZZAH32 · v2 Feather
v3 S3 TFT + A0/A1 PCB
(+ battery / buttons / TFT)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="520" width="300" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="19" value="Inside the critical path (show)

1. ArtDmx arrives on configured universe(s)
2. Bytes land in per-slot buffers in physical wire order
3. Virtual send resolution: sender sent fewer RGB triplets;
   receiver upscales to physical pixel count
4. show() / NeoPixel write — latency-sensitive (~30 FPS)

Grid rows/cols/serpentine are layout metadata for controllers;
they do not reorder ArtDmx bytes on the wire." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F4E5F;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="380" width="720" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="20" value="Commissioning path is separate: management GET_CONFIG / SET_* persist to NVS, ACK/NACK, never selected by ArtDmx source.
In production, commissioning mutations NACK/LOCKED; ArtDmx + discovery + PST + Hello stay live." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5E0DA;strokeColor=#8B3A2A;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="700" width="1380" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
