<mxCell id="13" value="Example — Badge (small_grid) + Collar (short_strip)

• A0 descriptor: grid 8×4, serpentine, virt=1 (workshop)
• A1 descriptor: strip 30 px, virt=30
• Split base universe 100 → A0 on 100, A1 on 101
• Eos patches two fixtures; DeviceManager only monitors PST

Hello: management/legacy identify flash on LEDs
(does not require standing ArtDmx connection)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F4E5F;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="400" width="700" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="14" value="What the device does NOT do

• No HTP/LTP merge of multiple ArtDmx sources
• No learning teleTarget from packet source
• No logical-coordinate ArtDmx reorder
• No receiver brightness channel
• Off slot still exists — zero physical pixels" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E5E9ED;strokeColor=#2C3E50;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="400" width="600" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
