<mxCell id="22" value="Runtime after config

• ArtPollReply advertises G:1P (prototype) or G:1L (locked); full descriptors only via GET_CONFIG
• PST carries operating/lock state, unlock-window remaining, sequence, uptime, FPS×10, packet rate, RSSI, battery
• Recovery: V3 D1 long-press · V1/V2 reboot + BOOT_WINDOW_UNLOCK within 60s — no casual remote unlock later" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F0E6;strokeColor=#3D5A40;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="520" width="1340" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
