<mxCell id="19" value="Loop priority (audio-first — not ArtDmx throughput)

1. audioUpdate() — highest when playing
2. ftpUpdate() — only when FTP active
3. Art-Net UDP drain (bounded batch)
4. WiFi check (throttled)
5. Buttons / display
6. PTR 1 Hz while playing · PFP 1 Hz

Never receives ArtDmx. No LED pixel path." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8B4513;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="420" width="720" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="20" value="SD / SPI contention: audio holds sdBusy → FTP refused while playing; play stops FTP first; FTP start stops audio first.
Success metric = no audio dropouts, not frame latency." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5E0DA;strokeColor=#8B3A2A;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="700" width="1380" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
