<mxCell id="19" value="Telemetry while alive

PTR → current track name + state
PFP → packet-rate heartbeat
ArtAudioStatus 0x8302 (branch)
→ DeviceManager / RadiusCentral UI" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F0E6;strokeColor=#3D5A40;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="320" width="540" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="20" value="Two production trigger styles on-device

A) Sender-authored Audio Cues: Central expands per-IP actions → ArtAudioCmd play/loop with filename
B) Device cue map: Central/OSC sends play_cue(N) → firmware resolves N from /cues.json (reboot/reload to pick up map edits)

Hello = cmd 5 test_tone at current volume (identify without LEDs).
Identity triad via ArtShowInfo — same Character / Performer / Device model as Primus." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8B4513;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="520" width="1340" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
