<mxCell id="2" value="D6 — Device-level comparison (one Primus node vs one Radius node)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F4E5F;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="900" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="3" value="Same LAN citizen · different critical path and storage" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F5F2;strokeColor=#F7F5F2;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="62" width="1200" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="4" value="PRIMUS RECEIVER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D6E8EE;strokeColor=#1F4E5F;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="680" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="5" value="Identity tag: PV3CAP1
Control/data port: :6454
Telemetry: PST → :6455 (opt-in target)

Critical path: ArtDmx assemble → NeoPixel show()
Storage: NVS (descriptors, IP, names, opMode, teleTarget)
Outputs: A0 + A1 LED ports (Off valid)
Show lock: firmware production mode
Identify: LED flash

Does not: play audio, open FTP, hold SD" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F4E5F;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="170" width="680" height="420" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="6" value="RADIUS RECEIVER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E6D8;strokeColor=#8B4513;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="120" width="640" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="7" value="Identity tag: PVRAD1
Control port: :6456 (radius-central)
Telemetry: PTR/PFP → :6455

Critical path: audioUpdate → VS1053 + SD SPI
Storage: SD WAVs + /cues.json (+ NVS net/identity)
Outputs: speaker via Music Maker
Show lock: operational (no opMode yet)
Identify: test tone

Does not: accept ArtDmx or drive LEDs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8B4513;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="170" width="640" height="420" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="8" value="Shared device behaviors: WiFi STA · ArtPoll discovery · rename · IP config · show-info names · Hello · firmware flash from Centrals/DeviceManager.
Cohabitation rule: Primus/Eos own :6454 pixels; Radius owns :6456 audio control; both may emit :6455 telemetry to an explicit monitor (often DeviceManager)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F0E6;strokeColor=#3D5A40;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="640" width="1380" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
